Description: Provides a design-first workflow for treatment-versus-control
    meta-analysis in agronomy. Version 1.0 consolidates effect-size construction,
    dependence-aware covariance modeling, random and multilevel synthesis, robust
    inference, meta-regression, dose-response analysis, multivariate outcomes,
    Bayesian sensitivity analysis, diagnostics, publication-bias sensitivity,
    visualization, reporting, and export. The stable integration layer adds an
    auditable end-to-end workflow, a capability registry, and a non-mutating
    installation/runtime doctor. Automatic routing decisions are recorded rather
    than hidden, and optional engines remain optional.
